fusal before encoding that names the offending field and code-unit index and tells the caller how to repair the text."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:storage","refusal","sentry","toon","unicode"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-10-15T13:21:41.694Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-15T13:21:41.694Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A lone surrogate in any persisted item text (metadata scalar, comment, note, learning, file note, body) refuses with exit 2 and code text_unpaired_surrogate naming the field path and code-unit index before any encode; Whole emoji and other astral characters still serialize and round-trip; The refusal is a PmCliError so Sentry no longer records an unclassified runtime fault; Unit coverage asserts the field path for a top-level scalar and a nested collection entry"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-o2kc"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"pm refuses ill-formed Unicode text at the storage boundary with an actionable typed error; Sentry PM-CLI-3H is resolved in the next release."}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"e018c083865a2eb5cf212a2a41aa154edf49e39d8cccd8164b4cd8d58be4b444","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_